    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "I'll start explaining the operation. First of all..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 141,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 142,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "I'll start explaining the operation. First of all..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 143,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "...... now you can run wild."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 146,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 147,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "Something seems to have exploded over there. The flames have risen from the front!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 149,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "There are 4 identified locations these explosion came from! I have ^FF0000shown them on your minimap.^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 157,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "It's quite sudden but, I'm changing the operation."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "Don't worry about those already at the front, they adjust to any situation."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 160,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 161,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "Divide into 4 teams, everyone at their own locations and start suppressing the leads. If any team finds Elyumina, let us know immediately."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 163,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 164,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "Everyone, to your position! Start the operation!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 173,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 174,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "I ask you to act separately adventurer. Please check your ^0000CDminimap^000000 to organize the situation as quickly as possible. Join the team if they need support!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 185,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 186,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "The briefing... the criminal here will be the one to do it."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 187,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "It's hard to babysit criminals."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 191,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 192,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "Haha! Isn't that your job? Do it properly. Why are you leaving the briefing to me?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 196,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 197,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "So noisy. Before we get started. Are you part of the USU now?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 201,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 202,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "That, that's what he said... are you afraid that I'll be scared!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 203,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "Heh, I'll do the explaining because I want to take care of my children!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 207,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 208,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "... Okay, it's almost time."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 209,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "My children will start setting up traps in <TIPBOX>[four places]<INFO>8086</INFO></TIPBOX>."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 212,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 213,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "Here, take the map. The information will also be delivered to the party members as well."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 214,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "You aren't alone right? You know my children are powerful?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 222,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 223,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "Go ahead and touch the traps. The traps will activate and my lovely children will appear."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 224,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "You do remember how the traps work, right?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 228,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 229,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "After you've cleared the four traps, EL1_A17T will come out, and this lady here will bring you to the same place as last time."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 233,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 234,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "That's it for the explanation. Now, get to work! Muscle idiots! Ahahaha!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 239,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 240,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "...I'll have a conversation with this criminal in a bit... Anyways. I'm counting on you, adventurers!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 260,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 261,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "text" : "That was fast... It was expected that my kids wouldn't win though."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 262,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "text" : "There's a lot more trouble going on up there~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 266,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 267,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "text" : "... are you going straight for my EL1-A17T?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 271,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "text" : "Go in."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 271,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "text" : "Don't go in yet."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 273,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 274,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "text" : "Come on, I was about to open it."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 278,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 279,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "text" : "Hahaha! Yes. Let's work hard. Gather more battle data for me!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 300,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 301,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "text" : "There is a suspicious box! A signal is being transmitted from the inside, it's currently being decrypted!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 306,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 307,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "text" : "Destroy the Biological Battery and kill the monsters!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 312,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 313,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "text" : "Sorry for the late analysis. It wasn't a device to summon monsters."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 315,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 316,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "text" : "After summoning the monsters, it summons a bio-battery to strengthen the monsters and explodes."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 318,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 319,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "text" : "If you want to handle it, just destroy it. It's good because it's a simple solution."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 321,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 322,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "text" : "Well, it looks like this is over...."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 324,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 325,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "text" : "It looks like you've found something interesting here. You should check out the other teams!"
    },
    {
