      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 616,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "text" : "Did I tell you that I'm really happy working with the Secret Wing? Thanks to them, I was chosen for this operation."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 618,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 619,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "text" : "Let's show them what we're all about, and that we're good guys."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 624,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 625,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "text" : "I haven't seen you in a while adventurer."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 627,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 628,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "text" : "I already know you adventurer, but please be careful."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 633,
      "npc" : "Box",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 634,
      "npc" : "Box",
      "text" : "Hello adventurer."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 637,
      "npc" : "Box",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 638,
      "npc" : "Box",
      "text" : "It was nice to be part of this squad, we've already taken care of this box."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 640,
      "npc" : "Box",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 641,
      "npc" : "Box",
      "text" : "These machines uses chemical poison, be careful."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 643,
      "npc" : "Box",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 644,
      "npc" : "Box",
      "text" : "We will now conduct our search, until the signal comes. Adventurer, be careful!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 655,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 656,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "I've been waiting for you. I've found the crazy researcher."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 657,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "The other guys are surrounding the place."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 659,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 660,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "In order to control such a machine in such a fine manner, Elyumina must be around."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 662,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 663,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "It would be possible for me to handle this machine, but then I wouldn't be able to catch Elyumina."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 665,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 666,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "If you take care of the machine, the other search parties will take care of finding Elyumina."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 669,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 670,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "The Rebellion squad is well coordinated, this work will be best suited for us. So leave that task to us."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 673,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 674,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "The place we'll enter will be at 9 o'clock. I confirmed that nobody was hiding there, and we blocked the exits."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 676,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
